            "path": "default/agents/skills/omarchy/SKILL.md",
            "name": "omarchy",
            "description": "REQUIRED for end-user customization of Linux desktop, window manager, or system config. Use when editing ~/.config/hypr/, ~/.config/omarchy/, ~/.config/alacritty/, ~/.config/foot/, ~/.config/kitty/, or ~/.config/ghostty/. Triggers: Hyprland, window rules, animations, keybindings, monitors, gaps, borders, blur, opacity, omarchy-shell, bar, terminal config, themes, background, night light, idle, lock screen, screenshots, reminders, layer rules, workspace settings, display config, and user-facing omarchy commands. Excludes Omarchy source development through `omarchy dev link` workflows.\n",
